{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026aYLyxHaSUl1794354575.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國飛機製造商波音10月共交付49架飛機，按月減少一成四，按年減少百分之7.5。</p><p></p><p>季內共交付32架737Max飛機、11架787夢幻飛機、777貨機及767貨機各2架，以及2架軍用機。累計今年首十個月交付524架飛機，按年增加約百分之6。</p><p></p><p>截至10月的新訂單，達到165架飛機。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T00:49:34.271302+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T23:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T04:37:15.940819+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T00:42:59.062734+00:00","content_hash":"6f199e7fd28989661da18475b6ab9e0dc67a6396123c7b586b8f2ccb5c6e552a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T00:49:34.271302+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}